# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:16
translate italian mrsmcgee7_1bfa8620:

    # "As we work on our assignments in English class, Mrs. McGee comes by my desk and puts her hand on my shoulder."
    "Mentre lavoriamo ai compiti durante la lezione di inglese, la signora McGee si avvicina al mio banco e mi mette una mano sulla spalla."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:17
translate italian mrsmcgee7_e0a44997:

    # et "[pcname], could you stay a bit after class. I need to talk to you about your Canterbury Tales essay."
    et "[pcname], potresti rimanere un po’ dopo la lezione? Devo parlarti del tuo saggio sui Racconti di Canterbury."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:18
translate italian mrsmcgee7_1ca80c77:

    # pc "Yes, ma'am."
    pc "Sì, signora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:21
translate italian mrsmcgee7_336feedb:

    # "Through the rest of the class, I worry about what she could want to talk to me about. It has been a week since we finished Canterbury tales, and I thought I did pretty good on that essay."
    "Per il resto della lezione, mi preoccupo di cosa possa volermi dire. È passata una settimana da quando abbiamo finito i Racconti di Canterbury e pensavo di aver fatto un buon lavoro con quel saggio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:22
translate italian mrsmcgee7_e846710c:

    # "Finally, class ends and all the other students start out the door, but I stay behind."
    "Finalmente la lezione finisce e tutti gli altri studenti escono dalla porta, ma io resto indietro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:25
translate italian mrsmcgee7_91684385:

    # et "Thanks for staying a little late. I just had a couple of questions I wanted to ask you about your essay."
    et "Grazie per essere rimasto un po’ più a lungo. Avevo solo un paio di domande da farti sul tuo saggio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:26
translate italian mrsmcgee7_63023601:

    # pc "Okay."
    pc "Ok."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:27
translate italian mrsmcgee7_64a3bccf:

    # et "The assignment was to choose your favorite story from The Canterbury Tales and write a synopsis and an analysis of the story as it relates to modern storytelling."
    et "Il compito era scegliere la tua storia preferita dai “Racconti di Canterbury” e scrivere una sinossi e un’analisi della storia in relazione alla narrativa moderna."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:28
translate italian mrsmcgee7_bf5ca486:

    # et "You chose The Miller's Tale. Why is that particular tale your favorite?"
    et "Hai scelto “Il racconto del mugnaio”. Perché proprio quel racconto è il tuo preferito?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:33
translate italian mrsmcgee7_90b318a5:

    # et "Yes, I suppose it is."
    et "Sì, suppongo di sì."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:34
translate italian mrsmcgee7_5b41f62c:

    # et "It is funny to read about this Miller whose beautiful wife is having sex with men behind his back, and he's completely oblivious."
    et "È divertente leggere di questo mugnaio la cui bellissima moglie fa sesso con altri uomini alle sue spalle, mentre lui se ne accorge di nulla."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:35
translate italian mrsmcgee7_23f8de94:

    # pc "I was more talking about the fart jokes, but yeah that's pretty funny too."
    pc "Mi riferivo più che altro alle battute sulle scoregge, ma sì, anche quella è piuttosto divertente."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:39
translate italian mrsmcgee7_589e3574:

    # et "Yes it is."
    et "Sì, lo è."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:40
translate italian mrsmcgee7_a1b1b58c:

    # et "I think it's interesting to hear that is the reason why it's your favorite."
    et "Trovo interessante sentire che è questo il motivo per cui è la tua preferita."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:42
translate italian mrsmcgee7_225d6c9f:

    # et "I was wondering if it might be your favorite because it's about a man whose beautiful wife is having sex with men behind his back?"
    et "Mi chiedevo se fosse la tua preferita perché parla di un uomo la cui bellissima moglie fa sesso con altri uomini alle sue spalle?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:43
translate italian mrsmcgee7_5ff3823e:

    # pc "I don't know. Maybe?"
    pc "Non lo so. Forse?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:46
translate italian mrsmcgee7_47e5b0f5:

    # et "Do you like the idea of having sex with a married woman?"
    et "Ti piace l’idea di fare sesso con una donna sposata?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:47
translate italian mrsmcgee7_c4594e48:

    # et "About humiliating her impotent husband? Showing him how a woman should be treated?"
    et "E quella di umiliare il marito impotente? Mostrargli come si dovrebbe trattare una donna?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:50
translate italian mrsmcgee7_9a72f950:

    # et "I thought you might."
    et "Pensavo che ti sarebbe piaciuto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:54
translate italian mrsmcgee7_26f420dd:

    # et "Oh, I'm sorry then. I misread something."
    et "Oh, allora mi dispiace. Ho frainteso qualcosa."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:55
translate italian mrsmcgee7_bec3fa51:

    # et "The essay is very good. You're doing great in class, [pcname]. I'll stop bothering you about anything… outside of class."
    et "Il saggio è molto bello. Stai andando alla grande in classe, [pcname]. Smetterò di disturbarti per qualsiasi cosa… al di fuori della classe."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:56
translate italian mrsmcgee7_d07e9fd4:

    # pc "Okay, Mrs. McGee. I'll talk to you later."
    pc "Va bene, signora McGee. Ci sentiamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:57
translate italian mrsmcgee7_dc1e70f2:

    # et "Bye, [pcname]."
    et "Ciao, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:59
translate italian mrsmcgee7_491dbae2:

    # "The rest of my classes pass without incident, then it's time to go to work."
    "Il resto delle mie lezioni trascorre senza intoppi, poi è ora di andare al lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:63
translate italian mrsmcgee7_cc5b1913:

    # et "There is a lot of language in the story that is difficult to understand. It's not exactly Old English, it's more like Old English slang."
    et "Nel racconto ci sono molte espressioni difficili da capire. Non si tratta proprio di inglese antico, è più simile a un gergo dell’inglese antico."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:64
translate italian mrsmcgee7_08d83e37:

    # et "Such as the line where Chaucer says that Nicholas grabs Alisoun \"by the queynte.\" Do you understand what that means?"
    et "Ad esempio, la frase in cui Chaucer dice che Nicholas afferra Alisoun “by the queynte”. Capisci cosa significa?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:69
translate italian mrsmcgee7_3a9f8ae2:

    # "I lean in and kiss her lips. I half-expect her to pull away from me, but she doesn't. She returns my kiss passionately, her tongue slipping in between my lips."
    "Mi chino verso di lei e le bacio le labbra. Mi aspetto quasi che si allontani da me, ma non lo fa. Ricambia il mio bacio con passione, facendo scivolare la lingua tra le mie labbra."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:70
translate italian mrsmcgee7_88e770e5:

    # "She presses herself against me, obviously hungry for more."
    "Si stringe contro di me, chiaramente desiderosa di di più."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:82
translate italian mrsmcgee7_b851c10c:

    # "I step up to her, reaching down between her legs and grabbing her while pressing my lips against hers."
    "Mi avvicino a lei, allungando la mano tra le sue gambe e afferrandola mentre premo le mie labbra contro le sue."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:83
translate italian mrsmcgee7_6836d91b:

    # "I half-expect her to pull away from me, or to yell out, but after the initial surprise of my touch, she starts pressing herself against me, kissing me back with a hunger, grinding her hips against my hand."
    "Mi aspetto quasi che si allontani da me, o che gridi, ma dopo la sorpresa iniziale per il mio tocco, inizia a strusciarsi contro di me, ricambiando il bacio con fame, muovendo i fianchi contro la mia mano."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:84
translate italian mrsmcgee7_a8ed1eb1:

    # "I could feel how warm and wet she was even through her dress."
    "Riuscivo a sentire quanto fosse calda e bagnata anche attraverso il vestito."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:86
translate italian mrsmcgee7_75e7549b:

    # et "That's too bad."
    et "Peccato."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:89
translate italian mrsmcgee7_ebc0b6c6:

    # et "Okay, [pcname], that's all I wanted to ask you. Your essay is very good and you're doing great in class."
    et "Ok, [pcname], era tutto quello che volevo chiederti. Il tuo saggio è molto bello e stai andando alla grande in classe."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:90
translate italian mrsmcgee7_367c3a3f:

    # et "You better get to your next class now."
    et "Faresti meglio ad andare alla tua prossima lezione adesso."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:91
translate italian mrsmcgee7_1ca80c77_1:

    # pc "Yes, ma'am."
    pc "Sì, signora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:92
translate italian mrsmcgee7_56ef2b64:

    # "I leave her class and walk to the next, not exactly sure what all of that was about."
    "Esco dalla sua classe e mi dirigo verso la prossima, senza capire bene di cosa si trattasse."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:93
translate italian mrsmcgee7_f32bd31b:

    # "The rest of my classes pass without incident, then it is time to go to work."
    "Il resto delle mie lezioni trascorre senza incidenti, poi è ora di andare al lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:99
translate italian mrsmcgee7_eb447035:

    # "Then, just as quickly and passionately as her kiss started, it ends when she forcefully pushes me away."
    "Poi, proprio con la stessa rapidità e passione con cui era iniziato, il suo bacio finisce quando lei mi spinge via con forza."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:100
translate italian mrsmcgee7_815cee6e:

    # et "No, [pcname]. We can't do this. I'm married and I love my husband."
    et "No, [pcname]. Non possiamo farlo. Sono sposata e amo mio marito."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:101
translate italian mrsmcgee7_bbb49d81:

    # pc "But…"
    pc "Ma…"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:102
translate italian mrsmcgee7_baa067de:

    # et "No buts. You should go."
    et "Niente ma. Dovresti andare."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:103
translate italian mrsmcgee7_6d9994c4:

    # pc "I don't understand."
    pc "Non capisco."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:104
translate italian mrsmcgee7_4f85d033:

    # et "This is not the time or place for this sort of outburst. We won't be discussing this anymore right now."
    et "Non è né il momento né il luogo adatto per questo tipo di sfogo. Non ne parleremo più adesso."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:105
translate italian mrsmcgee7_1f1c51ca:

    # et "Your essay is very good and you're doing great in class. Now get to your next class, we're done here."
    et "Il tuo saggio è molto bello e stai andando alla grande in classe. Ora vai alla tua prossima lezione, qui abbiamo finito."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:106
translate italian mrsmcgee7_f72d2804:

    # pc "Uh… okay. Bye, Mrs. McGee."
    pc "Ehm… va bene. Ciao, signora McGee."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:109
translate italian mrsmcgee7_0ccd1147:

    # "I leave her classroom, not exactly sure what had just happened."
    "Esco dalla sua aula, senza capire bene cosa sia appena successo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:110
translate italian mrsmcgee7_213f5c51:

    # "She's playing some sort of game and it feels like I'm just along for the ride."
    "Sta giocando a una specie di gioco e mi sembra di essere solo una pedina nella partita."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:111
translate italian mrsmcgee7_78fe728d:

    # "I guess I'll have to wait and see what happens next."
    "Immagino che dovrò aspettare e vedere cosa succederà dopo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee7.rpy:114
translate italian mrsmcgee7_0d69ab43:

    # "I go to my next class and the rest of the day passes without incident, then it's time to go to work."
    "Vado alla lezione successiva e il resto della giornata trascorre senza incidenti, poi è ora di andare al lavoro."

